	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Multi-virus CRISPR screening data in VeroE6 cells</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">We report the results of CRISPR survival screens in the context of multiple viral infections. Two sgRNA pools were used: one targeting the SARS-CoV-2 RNA interactome proteins, and one targeting mitochondrially-related proteins.</Item>
